ogesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 15 31 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm portion of breast  which is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  firm  tan white  ill defined mass extending to the margin  A representative section of the mass is frozen as FX 1 and resubmitted in cassette A  Further representative sections of the mass are submitted in cassettes B E  Normal breast parenchyma is submitted in cassette F  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  EXCISION , Positive.
